  "刺激、选择与反馈的脑区模式，有多少变化与运动有关？分析 201 个脑区的五类指标，提取跨指标协变结构，分离运动相关成分，映射脑区解剖图谱并交付报告，为后续实验留下更具体的线索。": "How much of the regional variation in stimulus, choice and feedback is linked to movement? Analyze five measures in 201 regions, identify shared structure, account for movement, and map the remaining patterns to guide follow-up research.",
  "小鼠全脑，": "Across the mouse brain,",
