  "不同任务信息？": "task information?",
  "小鼠全脑，如何组织不同任务信息？": "How is task information organized across the mouse brain?",
  "小鼠看图案、转轮作答，再得到奖励或错误提示。": "A mouse sees a pattern, turns a wheel, then receives a reward or an error cue.",
  "不同信息的脑区编码分布，是否协同变化，并与转轮运动相关？": "Do regional coding distributions covary across task variables, and are they related to wheel movement?",
  "由 SeekBrain 驱动，重新分析 201 个小鼠脑区的已有数据。": "Powered by SeekBrain, reanalyzing existing data from 201 mouse brain regions.",
  "个小鼠脑区": "mouse brain regions",
  "小鼠脑区解剖图谱 · 按已有 PC1 得分重绘": "Mouse anatomical atlas · Colored by saved PC1 scores",
  "如何组织不同任务信息？": "how is task information organized?",
  "小鼠全脑编码与解剖分布": "Mouse brain coding & anatomy",
  "重新分析已有的小鼠全脑数据：图案位置、左右选择与结果反馈的解码指标，在脑区间如何协同变化？这种关系与转轮运动有何关联？比较五类指标，计算运动相关成分，并将结果映射到脑区解剖图谱。": "Reanalyze existing mouse brain-wide data: how do decoding measures for pattern location, left/right choice and outcome feedback covary across regions? How is this related to wheel movement? Compare five measures, estimate movement-related components and map the results onto the anatomical atlas.",
  "SeekBrain 驱动 Agents-A1.5 再分析 201 个小鼠脑区的已有数据，连接跨任务编码的协变、运动相关成分与脑区解剖分布，为可检验的新假设提供依据。": "SeekBrain powers Agents-A1.5 to reanalyze existing data from 201 mouse brain regions, connecting covariation across task-coding measures, movement-related components and anatomical distributions to motivate testable hypotheses.",
  "小鼠的实验任务": "The mouse behavioral task",
  "刺激：看见图案": "Stimulus: see a pattern",
  "图案出现在屏幕左边或右边。": "A pattern appears on the left or right of the screen.",
  "选择：转轮作答": "Choice: turn a wheel",
  "小鼠用前爪转动小轮，把图案移向屏幕中央。": "The mouse turns a wheel with its front paws to bring the pattern to the center.",
  "反馈：获得结果": "Feedback: get the outcome",
  "答对得到水奖励；答错收到错误提示。": "A correct response earns water; an incorrect response triggers an error cue.",
  "小鼠完成一次看图案、转轮作答、获得结果的任务。研究比较的是：哪些脑区活动包含这些信息，以及它们与转轮动作的信息分布有何共同之处。": "As a mouse sees a pattern, turns a wheel and receives an outcome, different regions carry information about each event. The study compares where that information appears and what those maps share with the map of wheel movement.",
  "再分析表明：小鼠全脑不同任务信息的解码指标在脑区间协同变化，这种协变结构与转轮运动指标相关。": "The reanalysis shows that decoding measures for different task variables covary across mouse brain regions, and that this structure is associated with wheel-movement measures.",
  "不同任务信息，": "Different task signals.",
  "共同的运动相关模式。": "A shared pattern linked to movement.",
  "共同结构的统计检验与运动成分分析，让这一线索有据可查。": "Statistical checks of shared structure and movement-component analysis make this finding inspectable.",
  "已有数据，": "Existing data.",
  "可检验的新假设。": "New, testable hypotheses.",
  "SeekBrain 驱动模型重新分析已有数据，连接统计证据与脑区位置，": "SeekBrain guides the model through existing data, linking statistical evidence to brain regions,",
  "从跨指标协变及运动相关成分中，提出值得用新实验检验的问题。": "Use cross-metric covariation and movement-related components to formulate questions for new experiments.",
  "探索愿景：无预设方向地重访已有数据，让证据引出可检验的新假设。": "The ambition: revisit existing data without a preset direction, letting evidence lead to testable new hypotheses.",
  "如果在新实验中匹配转轮的方向和速度，部分脑区是否仍保留对图案位置或结果反馈的特异信息？": "If wheel direction and speed are matched in a new experiment, do some regions retain information specific to pattern location or feedback?",
  "验证思路：在独立数据中控制转轮运动，检查剩余信息是否稳定。": "How to test it: control wheel movement in independent data and check whether the remaining information is stable.",
  "假设示例为本展示基于结果的延伸推演，需后续实验检验。": "This example hypothesis is a showcase interpretation of the saved results, to be tested in future experiments.",
  "跨任务编码与运动的关联": "Task coding and its association with movement",
  "控制动作后，还剩什么？": "What remains when movement is controlled?",
  "重访已有数据，提出可检验的新假设。": "Revisit existing data. Generate testable new hypotheses.",
  "SeekBrain 连接数据再分析、统计检验与解剖图谱映射，让研究者能追溯证据，并据此提出可检验的新假设。": "SeekBrain connects data reanalysis, statistical checks and anatomical mapping so researchers can trace the evidence and formulate testable hypotheses.",
  "从小鼠实验出发，连接编码指标的协变、运动成分和脑区解剖分布。再分析已有数据，为可检验的新假设提供起点。": "Start with the mouse task, then connect covariation in coding measures, movement components and regional anatomy. Reanalysis provides a starting point for testable hypotheses.",
  "屏幕图案在左边还是右边？这个指标概括该小鼠脑区活动中包含多少图案位置信息。": "Was the screen pattern on the left or right? This measure summarizes how much information about pattern location is present in this mouse brain region.",
  "小鼠把小轮转向哪边来作答？这个指标概括该脑区活动中包含多少左右选择的信息。": "Which way did the mouse turn the wheel? This measure summarizes how much information about left/right choice is present in this region.",
  "小鼠收到水奖励还是错误提示？这个指标概括该脑区活动中包含多少结果反馈的信息。": "Did the mouse receive water or an error cue? This measure summarizes information about outcome feedback in this region.",
  "小轮转得有多快？这个指标概括该脑区活动中包含多少转轮快慢的信息。": "How fast did the wheel turn? This measure summarizes information about wheel speed in this region.",
  "小轮往哪个方向、以多快的速度转动？这个指标概括该脑区活动中包含多少带方向的转轮速度信息。": "How fast and in which direction did the wheel turn? This measure summarizes information about signed wheel velocity in this region.",
  "IBL / Allen 小鼠脑区解剖图谱 · 双侧同名脑区使用同一得分": "IBL / Allen mouse brain atlas · Homologous regions share the same score",
  "小鼠脑区解剖图谱 · Swanson 平面投影 · 点击脑区探索": "Mouse anatomical atlas · Swanson flatmap · Select a region",
  "小鼠看图案、转轮作答、获得奖励或错误提示。SeekBrain 驱动 Agents-A1.5 再分析 201 个小鼠脑区的已有数据，识别不同任务信息中跨任务编码与运动的关联，为可检验的新假设提供依据。": "A mouse sees a pattern, turns a wheel and receives reward or error feedback. SeekBrain powers Agents-A1.5 to reanalyze existing data from 201 mouse brain regions, identify a shared pattern linked to movement across task variables, and provide evidence for testable new hypotheses.",
